<title>UK: Grand Met says LVMH has 6.29 percent stake.</title>
<headline>Grand Met says LVMH has 6.29 percent stake.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>British drinks group Grand Metropolitan Plc said on Thursday that LVMH Moet Hennessy Louis Vuitton now holds a 6.29 percent stake in the company.</p>
</text>
